  "content": "\n\n<h1>EMF Compat: Core</h1>\n這是一套共享的用戶端程式庫，可讓所有 <strong>EMF Compat</strong> 擴充套件修復與 <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a></strong> 的動畫衝突。\n此模組本身不會新增任何可見的遊戲玩法功能，但它是每個 EMF Compat 擴充套件的<strong>必要</strong>依賴項目。\n<h2>運作原理</h2>\n當其他模組播放專屬的玩家動畫時（例如 Create 的飛鉤、Better Combat 的攻擊動作或 Carry On 的搬運狀態），該擴充套件會在 EMF 覆蓋之前，先捕捉目前的身體、手臂或頭部姿態，隨後再將姿態還原，確保外部動畫能正常顯示，而不被資源包的動畫取代。\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>所有 EMF Compat 擴充套件所需的共享程式庫。</li>\n<li>確保擴充套件的動畫能在帶有動畫的 EMF 玩家模型上正確呈現。</li>\n<li>於背景自動處理姿態的捕捉與還原。</li>\n<li>維持第一人稱與第三人稱視角的姿態一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>對應模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Not Enough Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Create</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-better-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Better Combat</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-carry-on\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Carry On</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-immersive-melodies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Immersive Melodies</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Quark</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emf-compat-supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF Compat: Supplementaries</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/z4FSlBqI/images/515107cd184542d6658a99434c089997357b34b7.gif\" alt=\"Supplementaries\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BPD5ZhBo/images/bae93f715fe88888f3e9b9cf4468ac96ba325eed.gif\" alt=\"Carry On\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Smytm33T/images/a8c92fd948fda83e1d1a57666baaf538901bea74.gif\" alt=\"Better Combat\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UvuFGp0l/images/444839c0908ae3322a66ab7a8b28eec190659c2b.gif\" alt=\"Quark 表情\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XLUpeCri/images/78a59aa9b67148fdd8a1da72ba2c0ae9610ba0b7.gif\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n祝您遊玩愉快 ^_^</div>",
